      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's what everyone says, \"it's temporary.\" what if it isn't? what if this is just how it is for me? sometimes it feels like there's a certain kind of peace in just... stopping. like, why is there such a huge stigma against just deciding you've had enough? isn't there a way to look at it that isn't just \"get help\"?",
